				"string" : "How to program? \nWe could start by \"designing\" the die, implementing it, then testing it. But how do we start designing?\nWe could start by writing tests. But what scenarios should be test?\nOr we could start by describing the scenarios as code, then turning these into examples and tests, iteratively building what we want."
